{"chapter": "etale-cohomology", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "0DDK", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\epsilon_{Y, *}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\epsilon_{Y, *} \\circ a_Y^{-1} = \\pi_Y^{-1}$", "MATH_0003": "$X$", "MATH_0004": "$a_Y^{-1}f_{small, *}\\mathcal{F} \\to f_{big, fppf, *}a_X^{-1}\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0005": "\\begin{align*}\n\\pi_Y^{-1}f_{small, *}\\mathcal{F}\n& =\n\\epsilon_{Y, *}a_Y^{-1}f_{small, *}\\mathcal{F} \\\\\n& \\to \n\\epsilon_{Y, *}f_{big, fppf, *}a_X^{-1}\\mathcal{F} \\\\\n& =\nf_{big, \\etale, *} \\epsilon_{X, *}a_X^{-1}\\mathcal{F} \\\\\n& =\nf_{big, \\etale, *}\\pi_X^{-1}\\mathcal{F}\n\\end{align*}", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-compare-higher-direct-image-proper}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-describe-pullback-pi-fppf}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{lemma-compare-higher-direct-image-proper}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:48fbfd9c716f38f6a2f6275ec194d8904b666ed3682f21acb8820f23b981b58f", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:e39e33de08872df7ff3341257ec50d7f04c7100d11a91e60d374c8df384f031e", "source_text": "You can prove this by repeating the proof of\nLemma <REF_0001> part (1);\nwe will instead deduce the result from this.\nAs <MATH_0001> is the identity functor on underlying presheaves,\nit reflects isomorphisms. The description\nin Lemma <REF_0002>\nshows that <MATH_0002>\nand similarly for <MATH_0003>. To show that the canonical map\n<MATH_0004>\nis an isomorphism, it suffices to show that\n<MATH_0005>\nis an isomorphism. This is part\n(1) of Lemma <REF_0003>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:05279042f991006d4de87c037aad1ca739fd7eac0bf81f81e14e778a163487e0", "unit_id": "tag:0DDN:proof"}
